  97:../../DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h **** /** Significantly more efficient than fmodf(x, 1.0f) for calculating
  98:../../DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h ****  *  the decimal part of a floating point value.
  99:../../DaisySP/Source/Utility/dsp.h ****  */
